WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.440
(content sigh) Oh hey!

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:11.680
I- Uh, I didn't like punishing myself over and over for these milestones.

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:15.700
So this time I thought I'd just, you know, relax.

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:19.760
Why do I need to punish myself anyway?

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:21.400
This is supposed to be a celebration!

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:22.840
And a 'thank you' to you guys.

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:27.440
So I came up with 101 ways to tell you how much I appreciate you guys.

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:30.660
#1 you guys have been with me since the beginning.

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:34.220
#2 you guys have been so appreciative of everything that I do.

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:37.520
*Ominous music*
Uh, 82: I know kung-fu all of a sudden, it's very bizarre.

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:39.720
I have no idea how that happened I just, uh....
*Music intensifies*

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:45.220
We know what you have done, we're coming to finish you off, *Creepy voice* we know.......

00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:47.260
Uh, eighty three.. (music heightens, blocking out Mark)

00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:48.220
*Splashing sounds*

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:51.940
(sounds of children creepily laughing)

00:00:52.340 --> 00:00:54.400
Darkiplier: *Laughing* One...

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.180
(muffled sounds of protest)

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:58.360
Darkiplier: Sealed for your protection.

00:00:58.360 --> 00:01:00.020
(muffled whining)

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:06.100
(heavy breathing)

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:12.740
(happy music plays)

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:20.160
(music fades out)

